    "detailed_description": "&quot;Run for the Bus&quot; is a 3D third-person runner game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe player takes on the role of a hungry girl who overslept in the morning.<br />\r\nChase her bus while she eats her bread on the colorful roads.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHer bus speed increases as the calendar progresses.<br />\r\nThe girl gradually becomes difficult to follow.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSometimes cats will fall from the sky.<br />\r\nPlease avoid.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWill the girl be able to avoid being late?",
